### std.hash facade — trait half

#### resolves the Hash trait through `use std.hash`

- Verify: resolves the Hash trait through `use std.hash`
   - Expected: p.hash() equals `65`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: resolves the Hash trait through `use std.hash`")
val p = FacadePoint(x: 2, y: 3)
expect(p.hash()).to_equal(65)
```

</details>

